      "filename": "20170805 Bolivia 1164 Sucre sRGB (37949354402).jpg",
      "title": "File:20170805 Bolivia 1164 Sucre sRGB (37949354402).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/20170805_Bolivia_1164_Sucre_sRGB_%2837949354402%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20170805_Bolivia_1164_Sucre_sRGB_(37949354402).jpg",
      "width": 3648,
